<title>KUWAIT: Gulf Bank 1996 net profit up 22.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Gulf Bank 1996 net profit up 22.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Gulf Bank reported on Wednesday a rise in 1996 net profit to 31.3 million dinars ($104.7 million) from 25.5 million dinars the previous year.</p>
<p>Total assets grew by 11.9 percent in 1996 to 1.63 billion dinars while return on assets rose to 2.04 percent from 1.8 the previous year, the bank said in newspaper advertisements.</p>
</text>
